## {{product}} documentation

Before explaining, reviewing or changing {{code_name}} code, follow `AGENTS.md`:

- page map `{{docs_dir}}/llms.txt`; index `{{docs_dir}}/agent/entities.jsonl`
- `python {{docs_dir}}/_tools/lookup.py <Name> [--kind K] [--find TEXT] [--src PATH]` — run from the workspace root; prints clickable `doc:` / `src:` path:line links, the code and its connections
- `python {{docs_dir}}/_tools/lookup.py --search "<question in words>"` when you know the topic but not the name
- `python {{docs_dir}}/_tools/trace_calls.py <Class.Method> [--up] [--entry]` — callees, callers, and what starts it
- `python` not found, or it opens the Microsoft Store (Windows)? Use `py -3` (or `python3`) for these commands instead
- skill: `.claude/skills/{{skill_name}}` (loads for {{code_name}} tasks; or `/{{skill_name}}`)
- graphify (if `graphify-out/` exists): `graphify query "<question>"` before grepping; `graphify update .` after code changes

Verify in the source before editing; never copy secret values.
